            <field>
              <name>BUFFERSIZE</name>
              <description>Must only be configured in STOP mode. Must be multiple of 16 bytes to make half-buffer size always
		64 bit word aligned. BUFFERSIZE LSB byte always fixed as 0xF to 16 bytes boundary. Minimum BUFFERSIZE value
		0x00F i.e. 16 bytes, maximum value 0xFFF i.e. 4096 bytes.</description>
              <lsb>0</lsb>
              <msb>11</msb>
              <enumeratedValues>
