                <description>DC offset cancellation value for the real or I channel. 2's complement value, where the number of integer bits are defined by the I channel size and the remainder bits are fractional. The fractional bits enter a wrapping accumulator and the carry from this is summed with the integer offset.</description>
                <lsb>0</lsb>
                <msb>11</msb>
              </field>
              <field>
                <name>DCOFFSETI1</name>
                <description>DC offset cancellation value for the real or I channel. 2's complement value, where the number of integer bits are defined by the I channel size and the remainder bits are fractional. The fractional bits enter a wrapping accumulator and the carry from this is summed with the integer offset.</description>
                <lsb>12</lsb>
                <msb>23</msb>
              </field>
            </fields>
