                <description>Filter Coefficient B14 for Quadrature phase stream. This is a Q10 format (i.e. output of filter is right-shifted by 10 bits) 2's complement value.Relevant when IQ_IMBALANCE_BYPASS = 0.</description>
                <lsb>0</lsb>
                <msb>11</msb>
              </field>
            </fields>
          </register>
