                <description>Number of sub-carriers per OFDM symbol (N_SC).Note that the number of sub-carriers is stored '-1', therefore the default of 107 corresponds to N_SC=108.The MIMO decoder supports N_SC468 is reserved.A software reset must be performed before changing N_SC.</description>
                <lsb>8</lsb>
                <msb>16</msb>
              </field>
              <field>
                <name>WLANMIMODECODERSTBCMODE</name>
                <description>Enable STBC mode (only applicable when N_RX=1).</description>
