                <description>Defines bits 61:38 of ExtRAM request ID 2 word address (bits 63:40 of the byte address).Note if greater than 64MBytes ExtRAM supported, MA[23] must be set to 0 and the lsb of this register used instead.</description>
                <lsb>0</lsb>
                <msb>23</msb>
